"A line exceeds 16 MiB. Scanning stopped without advancing past this line." = "单行超过 16 MiB，已停止该文件扫描，游标未越过该行。";
"Codex CLI executable not found. Specify the codex path." = "未找到可执行的 Codex CLI，请指定 codex 路径。";
"Codex app-server exited before statistics were loaded." = "Codex app-server 已退出，未完成统计读取。";
"Codex app-server returned an unrecognized protocol response." = "Codex app-server 返回了无法识别的协议响应。";
"Codex statistics contain invalid dates, duplicate daily buckets, or invalid values. No data was written." = "Codex 统计包含非法日期、重复日桶或无效数值，未写入。";
