"Pricing: %@" = "计价：%@";
"Server: %@" = "服务端：%@";
"Statistics: %@" = "统计：%@";
"The Codex desktop project cache exceeds 32 MiB. Existing mappings were kept and reading was stopped." = "Codex 桌面项目缓存超过 32 MiB，保留现有映射并停止读取。";
"The Codex statistics API returned error %lld. Existing history was kept." = "Codex 统计接口返回错误（%lld）；未改写已有历史。";
"The Codex statistics request timed out." = "Codex 统计接口读取超时。";
"The Codex statistics response exceeds the 4 MiB limit." = "Codex 统计响应超过 4 MiB 限制。";
"The Zstandard file is incomplete." = "Zstandard 文件不完整。";
