"The models.dev request failed (HTTP %lld). Existing prices were kept." = "models.dev 请求失败（HTTP %lld），保留已有价格。";
"The price response exceeds 32 MiB. The snapshot was not updated." = "价格响应超过 32 MiB，未更新快照。";
"The price response has no valid OpenAI model entries." = "价格响应缺少有效的 OpenAI 模型条目。";
"The server did not provide a verifiable account identity." = "服务端未提供可确认的账号归属。";
"The session_meta in the log does not match the conversation ID in the file name." = "日志的 session_meta 与文件名中的对话 ID 不一致。";
"The start date cannot be later than the end date." = "开始日期不能晚于结束日期。";
"The statistics timezone must be a valid IANA timezone." = "统计时区必须是有效的 IANA 时区。";
